a)	The property obtained is assessed at from VND 200,000,000 to under VND 500,000,000;
b)	The property appropriated is assessed at from VND 50,000,000 to under VND 200,000,000 or but the offender commits the offence in any of the cases specified in Point a through d Clause 1 of this Article.
