b)	A corporate legal entity that commits this offence in any of the cases specified in Clause 2 of this Article shall be liable to fine of from VND 1,000,000,000 to VND 3,000,000,000;
c)	A corporate legal entity that commits this offence in any of the cases specified in Clause 3 of this Article shall be liable to fine of from VND 3,000,000,000 to VND 5,000,000,000;
