1.	Any person who deliberately causes harmful interference or obstructs the normal operation of the radio information system and as a result causes property damage of from VND 200,000,000 to under VND 500,000,000, or previously incurred a civil penalty for the same offence or has a previous conviction for the same offence which has not been expunged, shall be liable to a fine of from VND 50,000,000 to VND 100,000,000 or face a penalty of up to 03 years' community sentence.
