a)	The offence involves ≥ 11 people;

b)	The illegal profit earned is ≥ VND 500,000,000;
c)	The offence results in the death of a person.
4.	The offender might also be liable to a fine of from VND 10,000,000 to VND 50,000,000 or prohibited from holding certain positions or doing certain jobs for 01 - 05 years.

##### Article 349. Organizing, brokering illegal emigration

