##### Article 372. Forcing a judicial officer to act against the law

1.	Any person who abuses his/her position or power to force a judicial officer to act against the law and as a results infringes upon the interest of the State, or the lawful rights and interests or another organization or individual or causes property damage of from VND 50,000,000 to under VND 200,000,000 shall face a penalty of 06 - 36 months' imprisonment.
2.	This offence committed in any of the following cases shall carry a penalty of 02 - 05 years' imprisonment:
b) The offence has been committed more than once;
b)	The offence results in an illegal judgment or decision;
c)	The offence involves the use of violence, threat of violence, or other dangerous or deceitful methods;
d)	The offence results in property damage of from VND 200,000,000 to under VND 1,000,000,000;
dd) The offence has a negative impact on social security, order, or safety.
